Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.98,0:23:40.00,EpTitle,,0,0,0,,日常篇也超喜欢的~~~
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.17,0:00:05.26,Dial-CN,,0,800,0,,五条同学和海梦在交往吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.34,0:00:08.10,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,告诉我们吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.64,0:00:10.18,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,等一下 五条同学
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.68,0:00:12.14,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.31,0:00:14.79,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,不过老实说我也很在意
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.85,0:00:16.75,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,毕竟你们经常在一起的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.81,0:00:17.87,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,话说回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.94,0:00:19.75,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,其他班的家伙好像说过在夏日祭典
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.82,0:00:21.21,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,有看到像是喜多川你们两个的人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.28,0:00:22.19,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.90,0:00:23.80,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,有去有去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.86,0:00:25.05,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,因为我很想去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.11,0:00:25.82,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,毕竟是夏天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.07,0:00:27.42,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,什么毕竟是夏天…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.49,0:00:29.43,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,你没有邀我们啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.49,0:00:30.33,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,倒是邀我们去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.49,0:00:32.55,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,也要邀我去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.62,0:00:34.14,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,所以到底是怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.21,0:00:36.27,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,没有 不是那样的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.33,0:00:37.98,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,完全…没有那种事…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:39.34,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,我们没有在交往
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.59,0:00:43.02,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,话说都湿答答了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.09,0:00:44.27,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,去拿毛巾吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.34,0:00:44.90,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,抱 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.97,0:00:46.97,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,人太多完全走不到…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.51,0:00:49.39,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,海梦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.60,0:00:50.32,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.39,0:00:51.39,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.39,0:00:55.49,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.56,0:00:56.83,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,快交往不就好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.90,0:00:57.50,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.56,0:01:01.50,Dial-CN-UP,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hello 你现在有看见美好的世界吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.02,0:01:01.50,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,话说为什么都是菅谷在唱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.57,0:01:02.79,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,也让我唱几首啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.86,0:01:03.61,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.54,0:01:15.16,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,交往什么的 绝对不可能…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.58,0:01:17.79,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,像我这种人怎么可能…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.71,0:01:20.21,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,太不自量力了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.38,0:01:30.05,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,虽然确实没有在交往…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.68,0:01:34.18,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,但也没必要像那样拼命否认吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.52,0:01:35.49,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,话说回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.56,0:01:38.94,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,朱朱大人问的时候也是立刻否定呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.44,0:01:46.28,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,有那么讨厌我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.82,0:01:48.66,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,真让人沮丧啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.58,0:01:55.08,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,能说几句话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.83,0:02:00.10,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,抱歉 喜多川同…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.17,0:02:01.94,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,唉？ 你不来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.00,0:02:04.52,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,来嘛 现在玩得很嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.59,0:02:05.51,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,很开心的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.93,0:02:14.78,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,如果只有我们的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.85,0:02:16.93,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,海梦会一直被搭讪很辛苦的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.35,0:02:21.21,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,我不就说了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.27,0:02:22.56,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,到底要让我说几次…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.20,0:02:30.11,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.78,0:02:32.20,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,由我来不行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.08,0:02:37.18,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.25,0:02:39.12,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,虽然我也这么想…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.00,0:02:41.33,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,我 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.62,0:02:44.02,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,虽然不会说什么风趣的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.09,0:02:44.90,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.96,0:02:46.19,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,我会代替她…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.25,0:02:47.80,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,好好努力
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.96,0:02:50.22,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,让你们开心的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.47,0:02:52.76,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,所 所以请放过喜多川同学…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.93,0:02:56.24,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,他是不是误会你在搭讪了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.31,0:02:57.24,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.31,0:02:58.28,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,对海梦搭讪？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.35,0:02:59.87,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,不对 不对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.93,0:03:01.64,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,别这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.23,0:03:07.53,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,该不会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.28,0:03:11.99,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,你们是喜多川同学认识的人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.66,0:03:16.84,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,他们是我常去的美容院的美容师
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.91,0:03:18.10,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,刚好遇到了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.16,0:03:19.93,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,然后正在念她呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.00,0:03:21.56,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,把人说的真难听啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.62,0:03:23.79,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,我是在提醒她 提醒！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.13,0:03:25.23,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.29,0:03:26.31,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,果然伤到头发了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.38,0:03:27.98,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,电棒卷的温度调太高了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.05,0:03:30.36,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,理穗小姐好不容易帮你做了那么好的护发
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.42,0:03:32.15,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,还有居然穿得这么少
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.22,0:03:33.19,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,都从事模特儿的工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.26,0:03:33.90,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,可不能让身体着凉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.97,0:03:35.95,Dial-CN,,0,800,0,,你该不会就是五条同学吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.97,0:03:34.70,Dial-CN,,800,0,0,,可不能让身体着凉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.76,0:03:35.95,Dial-CN,,800,0,0,,要是感冒的话要怎么办啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.01,0:03:37.18,Dial-CN,,800,0,0,,编辑会很困扰的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.01,0:03:37.18,Dial-CN,,0,800,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.35,0:03:38.28,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,先说清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.35,0:03:40.53,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,我可不是要找麻烦才这么说的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.60,0:03:41.91,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,我知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.98,0:03:43.16,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,多管闲事的大妈
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.23,0:03:44.75,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,好歹说是姐姐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.81,0:03:45.58,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,听力真好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.65,0:03:47.25,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,明明是你故意讲得让我听得见
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.32,0:03:48.38,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,没有那种事哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.44,0:03:50.21,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,俗话不是说 说谎是当小偷的开端吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.28,0:03:52.09,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,不是也有说谎是种权宜之计的说法吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.15,0:03:54.16,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,你就只会一直顶嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.58,0:03:59.14,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,就说你太在意了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.20,0:04:01.54,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,搞错也是常有的事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.96,0:04:03.10,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.16,0:04:04.22,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,小光他们也说了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.29,0:04:06.79,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,要剪头发的话就去他们的店吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.00,0:04:07.90,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,打起精神来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.96,0:04:10.23,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,但是 我对他们非常失礼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.30,0:04:11.88,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,我总是把事情搞砸…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.38,0:04:15.93,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,我真的是…为什么会搞成这样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.47,0:04:19.41,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,为什么我总是会一直这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.47,0:04:20.97,Dial-CN,,0,800,0,,话说回来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.47,0:04:20.97,Dial-CN,,800,0,0,,为什么我总是会一直这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.39,0:04:26.44,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,他保护了我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.99,0:04:40.03,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,吓了一大跳
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.49,0:04:41.35,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.41,0:04:42.58,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,喜多川同学
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.46,0:04:47.21,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.92,0:04:49.04,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,你在生气吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.29,0:04:50.67,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,我做错了什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.00,0:04:51.63,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,为什么会这么想？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.75,0:04:52.42,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,你刚刚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.67,0:04:53.73,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,啧了一声
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.80,0:04:55.43,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,你刚刚咂嘴了一声对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.59,0:04:57.65,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,完全不是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.72,0:04:58.53,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,我才没有咂嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.60,0:05:00.20,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,那刚刚的声音是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.26,0:05:01.68,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,那你做了什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.85,0:05:07.60,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,怎 怎么可能跟你说啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.94,0:05:09.04,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,喜多川同学
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.11,0:05:10.54,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,你果然生气了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.61,0:05:12.67,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,如果我做错了什么的话 我愿意道歉的…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.73,0:05:14.32,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,就说了不是那样…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.95,0:05:17.61,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,奇怪？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.57,0:05:24.14,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}アオイハル 続いてく未来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.14,0:05:25.60,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}なんでもない なんでもない 今日も
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.60,0:05:27.08,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}キミとなら Make it fun
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.43,0:05:44.45,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}踊る風にさそわれた 坂道の向こうがわに
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.52,0:05:50.19,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}こまでも広がる青瞳を奪われて
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.57,0:05:54.84,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}音立てる ときめきの予感
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.90,0:06:00.74,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}真っ白な秘めた気持ちが 色づいてゆく
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.37,0:06:03.22,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}さぁ 行こう
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.29,0:06:08.64,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}キミと 紬いでく未来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.71,0:06:14.23,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}今はまだ手探りで迷っても
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.30,0:06:19.53,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}放物線描き出す光
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.59,0:06:25.62,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}七色の明日が呼んでる
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.68,0:06:28.41,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}道しるべ なくたって
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.48,0:06:31.16,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}不安なら わけあって
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.23,0:06:33.92,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}キミがいる いつだって
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.98,0:06:36.74,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}ほら笑って Hi-Five
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.57,0:05:24.14,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}稚嫩的青春 延续向未来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.14,0:05:25.60,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}平凡无奇 平凡无奇 今天也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.60,0:05:27.08,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}和你在一起 Make it fun
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.43,0:05:44.45,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}受到起舞的风邀请 去到坡道另一边
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.52,0:05:50.19,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}无边无际的蓝 吸引了我的双眼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.57,0:05:54.84,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}发出声响的 悸动预感
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.90,0:06:00.74,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}隐藏的纯白心情 逐渐染上色彩
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.37,0:06:03.22,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}来吧 出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.29,0:06:08.64,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}与你 一起编织 未来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.71,0:06:14.23,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}就算现在还在摸索 还在迷惘
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.30,0:06:19.53,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}描绘出 抛物线的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.59,0:06:25.62,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}七彩的明天 正在呼唤我们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.68,0:06:28.41,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}即使没有 路标
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.48,0:06:31.16,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}有不安 就一起分担
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.23,0:06:33.92,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}有你在 永远
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.98,0:06:36.74,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}来 笑一个吧 Hi-Five
